       2010-LEER-PEND.
      *---------------*

           READ FICH-PEND INTO WE-ENTRADA
                AT END MOVE 'S' TO SW-FIN-FICH-PEND
           END-READ.

           IF NO-FIN-FICH-PEND
              ADD 1 TO CT-LEIDOS-PEND
           END-IF.

